OL,3,AIran war won't end until after crucial
OL,4,ANovember elections, says Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump is facing falling polling numbers
OL,7,Fand pressure from within his Republican
OL,8,FParty to end the war with Iran. On
OL,9,FWednesday, oil prices rose to $100
OL,10,F(#74) for the first time since July due
OL,11,Fto increased fighting in the Middle
OL,12,FEast.
